#: .\ui\ficheros_api\importacion.py:294
msgid ""
"Obligatorio. Todo producto debe pertenecer a un departamento. Si no existe, "
"se crea automáticamente."
msgstr ""
"Required. Every product must belong to a department. If it does not exist, "
"it is created automatically."

